{"title": "Fog", "pageid": 18724, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fog", "categories": ["Clouds", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Fog_Cloud\" title=\"Fog Cloud\">Fog Cloud</a>        </div>\n<div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fog_cloud.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Fog_cloud.png/300px-Fog_cloud.png.webp, /w/images/9/96/Fog_cloud.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Fog image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Fog_cloud.png/300px-Fog_cloud.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/Fog_cloud.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Fog</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cloud\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cloud\">cloud</a> that blinds and obscures creatures within, and blocks sight, blocking NPC sight cones and preventing attacks and spells which require sight.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Heavily Obscures and Blinds creatures within.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Cloud\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Cloud</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Blinded\"> Condition: Blinded </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blinded</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Whilst on surface</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>. Range of attacks and spells reduced to 3 m (10 ft).</li>\n<li>Attack Rolls against Blinded creatures have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creation\">Creation</span></h2>\n<p>This area can be created by the following:\n</p><p>Items:\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume\" title=\"Cloak of Cunning Brume\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak_of_Cunning_Brume\" title=\"Cloak of Cunning Brume\">Cloak of Cunning Brume</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hammergrim_Mist_Amulet\" title=\"Hammergrim Mist Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hammergrim_Mist_Amulet\" title=\"Hammergrim Mist Amulet\">Hammergrim Mist Amulet</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<p>Spells and actions:\n</p>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r347748\"><div class=\"div-col\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fog_Cloud\" title=\"Fog Cloud\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp/45px-Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp/60px-Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fog Cloud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fog_Cloud\" title=\"Fog Cloud\">Fog Cloud</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic:_Fog\" title=\"Wild Magic: Fog\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Wild_Magic_Fog_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Magic_Fog_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/93/Wild_Magic_Fog_Icon.webp/45px-Wild_Magic_Fog_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/93/Wild_Magic_Fog_Icon.webp/60px-Wild_Magic_Fog_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Magic: Fog\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Wild_Magic_Fog_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Magic_Fog_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/93/Wild_Magic_Fog_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic:_Fog\" title=\"Wild Magic: Fog\">Wild Magic: Fog</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>There is a known bug regarding the <code>IgnoreSurfaceCover</code> internal boost which manifests with <b>Fog</b>. Specifically, if a surface has the property <code>CanSeeThrough = false</code> but <code>CanShootThrough = true</code> (like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fog_Cloud\" title=\"Fog Cloud\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp/40px-Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fog Cloud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fog_Cloud\" title=\"Fog Cloud\">Fog Cloud</a>), <i>any</i> active <code>IgnoreSurfaceCover</code> boost allows a creature to see through it. Conversely, if <code>CanShootThrough = false</code> (like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkness\" title=\"Darkness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/20px-Darkness_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/30px-Darkness_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/40px-Darkness_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/20px-Darkness_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness\" title=\"Darkness\">Darkness</a>), the creature must have the specific <code>IgnoreSurfaceCover(SurfaceDarknessCloud)</code> boost to see through it. The result is that features which grant sight through Magical Darkness (e.g., <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Sight\" title=\"Devil's Sight\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/25px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/38px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/50px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Devil's Sight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/25px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Sight\" title=\"Devil's Sight\">Devil's Sight</a>) implicitly grant sight through Fog, but Fog-specific protections do not work against Darkness.<br></li></ul>\n<dl><dd>The <a href=\"/wiki/Sight_mechanics\" title=\"Sight mechanics\">Sight mechanics</a> page explains this bug in further detail.</dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202010\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.079 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2725/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29304/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7631/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 982/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.030/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1118597/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   65.226      1 -total\n 98.71%   64.384      1 Template:Area_page\n 18.70%   12.199      2 Template:Item_icon\n 18.35%   11.972      6 Template:Icon_link\n 18.09%   11.796     27 Template:Trim\n 17.33%   11.306      6 Template:Icon_text\n 17.11%   11.163      1 Template:Condition\n 11.30%    7.373      2 Template:Div_col\n 11.21%    7.311      4 Temp